  "content": "<h1>獨特暗黑</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/modrinth@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Modrinth 上的獨特暗黑\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/curseforge@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 CurseForge 上的獨特暗黑\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/patreon@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上的 AmongstReality\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/bmc@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Buy Me a Coffee 上的 AmongstReality\"></a></p><p>這個資源包為遊戲中每個功能性方塊提供了獨特的紋理。部分紋理需要安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a> 才能正常顯示。</p><p>獨特暗黑支援許多不同的模組，並且幾乎每次更新都會增加更多支援。</p><h2>獨特暗黑 - Lite 版 vs 完整版</h2><p><strong>獨特暗黑 - Lite 版</strong> 是可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> 下載的版本。</p><p><strong>獨特暗黑 - 完整版</strong> 則可從我的 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a> 取得。</p><blockquote>\n  <p>⚠️ <strong>警告：</strong> 此資源包僅可從上述平台下載，且其在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252funique-dark%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 也有獨立頁面。若在其他平台找到此資源包，<strong>請勿下載</strong>，因為這些平台未經授權且非官方重新發布，下載連結可能導向惡意網站，下載內容可能含有病毒。</p>\n</blockquote><p>以下清單顯示了 Lite 版和完整版中包含的紋理，以及哪些紋理需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a> 才能正常運作。未包含在 Lite 版中的紋理也經過重新繪製，以符合資源包的藝術風格。</p><h3>✅ Lite 版包含：</h3><ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>熔爐</li>\n<li>儲物箱</li>\n<li>銅製儲物箱</li>\n<li>預設界伏盒</li>\n<li>鐵砧</li>\n<li>鐵砧變種</li>\n<li>附魔台</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>村民職業變種</li>\n<li>可騎乘生物變種</li>\n<li>駱馬變種</li>\n</ul><h3>✅ 完整版額外包含（除了 Lite 版所有內容外）：</h3><ul>\n<li>高爐</li>\n<li>煙燻爐</li>\n<li>陷阱儲物箱</li>\n<li>終界儲物箱</li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>銅製儲物箱變種</li>\n<li>彩色界伏盒</li>\n<li>釀造台</li>\n<li>切石機</li>\n<li>砂輪</li>\n<li>製圖台</li>\n<li>鍛造台</li>\n<li>紡織機</li>\n<li>發射器</li>\n<li>投擲器</li>\n<li>合成器</li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n</ul><h3>⚠️ 需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a></h3><ul>\n<li>陷阱儲物箱</li>\n<li>終界儲物箱</li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>銅製儲物箱</li>\n<li>銅製儲物箱變種</li>\n<li>彩色界伏盒</li>\n<li>鐵砧變種</li>\n<li>發射器</li>\n<li>投擲器</li>\n<li>村民職業變種</li>\n<li>可騎乘生物變種</li>\n<li>駱馬變種</li>\n</ul><h2>在此支持我和我的專案：</h2><p>您可以透過加入 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a> 的紫水晶級會員來獲取獨特暗黑完整版。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/patreon@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/bmc@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p><h2>模組支援（目前支援 79 個模組）</h2><p>您可以在<a href=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/Unique-Dark-Issues/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>提出模組支援請求，我可能會在未來添加。目前支援的模組如下：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faccessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">飾品 (Accessories)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancedae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdvancedAE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-import-export-card\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 匯入匯出卡</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex 的洞穴 (Alex's Caves)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化 (Apotheosis)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-attributes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化屬性 (Apothic Attributes)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化附魔 (Apothic Enchanting)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-spawners\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化生怪磚 (Apothic Spawners)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蘋果皮 (AppleSkin)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2-wireless-terminals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">應用能源2 無線終端 (Applied Energistics 2 Wireless Terminals)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">應用能源2 (Applied Energistics 2)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-flux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">應用通量 (Applied Flux)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appliede\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppliedE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farmor-hud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">護甲HUD (Armor Hud)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faxiom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">公理 (Axiom)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">背包滿載 (Backpacked)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-furnaces-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的熔爐：重鑄 (Better Furnaces Reforged)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbrewin-and-chewin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">釀造與咀嚼 (Brewin' And Chewin')</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fclientsort\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">客戶端排序 (Client Sort)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">裝飾性護甲重製 (Cosmetic Armor Reworked)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcrafting-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">合成調整 (Crafting Tweaks)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">機械動力 (Create)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API (Forge)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feasy-shulker-boxes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡易界伏盒 (Easy Shulker Boxes)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchancement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔強化 (Enchancements)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔灌注台 (Enchanting Infuser)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體紋理特徵 (Entity Texture Features)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">曝光 (Exposure)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-pattern-provider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ExtendedAE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extreme-sound-muffler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">極致消音器 (Extreme sound muffler) (Forge)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事 (Farmer's Delight)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火：龍 (Ice and Fire: Dragons)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸式飛機 (Immersive Aircraft) [Fabric/Forge]</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fin-game-account-switcher\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">遊戲內帳號切換器 (In-Game Account Switcher)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inmis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inmis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventorio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventorio</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finventory-management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">庫存管理 (Inventory Management)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-profiles-next\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">背包檔案 Next (Inventory Profiles Next)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firon-chests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵儲物箱 (Iron Chests)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵熔爐 (Iron Furnaces)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fplugin%252fitemswapper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemSwapper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jobsaddon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">職業附加 (JobsAddon)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-leveling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Leveling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/language-reload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">語言重新載入 (Language Reload)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/levelz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LevelZ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LibZ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/merequester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ME 請求器 (ME Requester)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mega-cells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MEGA 單元 (MEGA Cells)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod 選單 (Mod Menu)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moving-elevators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">移動電梯 (Moving Elevators)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish 的家具模組：翻新 (MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod: Refurbished)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmusic-notification\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">音樂通知 (Music Notification)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals-decorations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神話金屬裝飾 (Mythic Metals Decorations)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-nether-chest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地獄儲物箱 [Forge &amp; Fabric] (Nether Chested)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-chat-reports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NoChatReports</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">聖騎士的家具 (Paladin's Furniture)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">夸克 (Quark)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/raised\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">提高 (Raised)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">足夠的物品 (Roughly Enough Items) (REI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252funiversal-sawmill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鋸木機 (Sawmill)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fshulkerboxtooltip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">界伏盒提示 (ShulkerBoxTooltip)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-uncrafting-table-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡易返工台 (Simple Uncrafting Table)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡單語音聊天 (Simple Voice Chat)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精緻背包 (Sophisticated Backpacks)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精緻儲存 (Sophisticated Storage)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">儲物抽屜 (Storage Drawers)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">補遺 (Supplementaries)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林 (The Twilight Forest)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftoms-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom 的簡易儲存模組 (Tom's Simple Storage Mod)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trashslot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">垃圾欄 (TrashSlot)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">旅者背包 (Traveler's Backpack)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">飾品 (Trinkets) (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useful-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">實用背包 (Useful Backpacks)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnotebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版筆記本 (Vanilla Notebook)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳送石 (Waystones)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remot